# Pulse chat bubble layout (anti-regression)

## Problem (8587c39 + dir=auto)

`dir="auto"` on Arabic assistant text inside a **full-width** AI bubble parks the
prose on the far right while LTR chrome (AI badge, navigate buttons) stays on
the far left — a hollow middle rail.

## Required

- Cap AI bubble width (`maxWidth: min(42rem, 96%)`), not bare `width: 100%`.
- Keep navigate / download action chips in the **same column** as the reply
  (`dir="auto"` on the action row is OK).
- Do not “fix” RTL by stretching the assistant bubble edge-to-edge.

## Related product guard

Deliverable asks (“تقرير … word file”) must not NAV-GATE to open Payroll —
see `is_deliverable_request` in `process_brief.py`.
